# Receipt Scanner

- Read `PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md` first, then only the files relevant to the task.
- Treat `AGENTS.md` as the shared source of truth. Read the matching recipe in
  `.agents/playbooks/` before changing adapters, APIs, DB, frontend, scanner,
  debugging, or checks.
- Keep changes narrow: one feature or bug per patch; no drive-by formatting,
  renames, or new dependencies.
- Never expose secrets, cookies, phone numbers, credentials, or receipt data.
- Never delete, recreate, or rewrite `backend/data` or its backups.
- Prefer targeted searches and focused tests. Do not read large planning docs,
  generated folders, APKs, caches, or virtual environments unless required.
- Report changed files, validation, and blockers briefly; use `path:line`.
